  frame:
    shape: 1-pixel-thick hollow rectangle (perimeter only), size 5-8 x 5-8
    margins: >=2 cells from every grid edge
  cross:
    shape: full-spanning cross — one row + one column of cross_color across entire grid
    intersection: strictly inside frame interior (not on frame border)
    occlusion: frame border pixels overwrite cross where they overlap (4 hidden pixels)
    visible_pixels: W + H - 1 - 4 = 19 [observed, follows from 12x12 grid]
  output_rule: |
    Erase cross from original position. Redraw cross_color along frame's
    top row (fr0) and right column (fc1), spanning the full grid width/height.
